# Keep agent instruction files and durable memory readable by Cursor CLI/editor.
# Cursor honors .gitignore for indexing; these negations re-include the files.
# `.ai/` is a hidden directory and is otherwise easy for search/index to skip.
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/GEMINI.md
!/GROK.md
!/.github/
!/.github/copilot-instructions.md
!/.ai/
!/.ai/**
